  "<item>\n                                            <title><![CDATA[World of Hyatt Hotels & Resorts Offer: Earn 3K Bonus Points Every 3 Night Stay Free to Register (Up to 36K Points thru 12/15)]]></title>\n                                                <link>https://slickdeals.net/f/20078985-world-of-hyatt-hotels-resorts-offer-earn-3k-bonus-points-every-3-night-stay-free-to-register-up-to-36k-points-thru-12-15?utm_source=rss&amp;utm_content=fp&amp;utm_medium=RSS2</link>\n                                                <description>Members of World of Hyatt (free to join) may register today to earn 3K Bonus Points for _every 3 eligible nights_ at all hotels participating in World of Hyatt, then use points toward future travel. ...</description>\n                                                <content:encoded><![CDATA[<div><img src=\"https://static.slickdealscdn.com/attachment/8/6/6/3/0/300x300/21769293.thumb\" alt=\"World of Hyatt Hotels &amp; Resorts Offer: Earn 3K Bonus Points Every 3 Night Stay Free to Register (Up to 36K Points thru 12/15)\" height=\"300\" width=\"300\"></div><br /><div>Thumb Score: +12 </div><div>Members of World of Hyatt (free to join) may register today to earn 3K Bonus Points for <u>every 3 eligible nights</u> at all hotels participating in World of Hyatt, then use points toward future travel.  You may earn up to 36k bonus points in addition to the 5 base points you would've earned.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://slickdeals.net/click?lno=1&amp;trd=b%20Register%20Here%20b&amp;pv=&amp;au=&amp;u3=MibHF8odWIWpeaoVTEwGcalNNaeKtL2HgEZvgZz7KNFCI3c97iY6F7MZnppYQ3oPaJ_mqbeptngCGw2SsZY6U9PN6-Qx9tEEQuZvx1YvKrIdoRIsEVajLlNnyQacZQ\" target=\"_blank\" data-product-forum=\"Hot Deals\" data-product-products=\"\" data-cta=\"outclick\" data-outclick-typeofoutclick=\"Post Content Link\" data-product-exitWebsite=\"hyatt.com\" data-store-id=\"15658\" data-store-slug=\"hyatt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><b>Register Here</b></a> <span class=\"externallink\">[<a href=\"https://slickdeals.net/click?lno=1&amp;trd=b%20Register%20Here%20b&amp;pv=&amp;au=&amp;u3=MiabmHdsdv-myFrbmuCNX824nKE452Y0qTVa7FaZL7VajYXMuM78E5qbE4Iv2opUjcr58bowpsQ5v07Vb4TTsPmWZ7smM3eif3GtHRkFlX6FgcJflnzp1whnr5Ckkg\" target=\"_blank\" data-product-forum=\"Hot Deals\" data-product-products=\"\" data-cta=\"outclick\" data-outclick-typeofoutclick=\"Post Content Link\" data-product-exitWebsite=\"hyatt.com\" data-store-id=\"15658\" data-store-slug=\"hyatt\" rel=\"nofollow\">hyatt.com</a>]</span><br />\r\nStay Through December 15, 2026<br />\r\n<br />\r\nValid",
