</li> <li>Detects snoring sounds with bone conduction sensors</li> <li>Features multiple levels of intensity and sensitivity settings</li> <li>Provides up to 15 hours of battery life per charge</li> <li>Model: YA4600</li> </ul> </div>]]></description>\n   <guid>https://www.dealnews.com/22231868.html?iref=rss</guid>\n   <pubDate>Thu, 01 Oct 2026 06:00:00 -0400</pubDate>\n   <dealnews:retailer>snorecircle.com</dealnews:retailer>\n   <dealnews:expires>2026-10-16T00:00:00-04:00</dealnews:expires>\n   <dealnews:dealType>prod",
